# MBA CONSULTANCY REACT SITE - MASTER RULES (STRICT)

## 🎨 COLORS (MANDATORY - FROM VISITING CARD)
- Navy Primary: #00275E (bg-navy, text-navy)
- Navy Dark: #0F162D (hover: bg-navy-dark)
- Offwhite BG: #FAFAFA (bg-offwhite)
- Offwhite Light: #F8FAFC (hover: bg-offwhite-light)
- Gold Muted: #C9A55E (border-gold-muted, accent)
- Gold Soft: #D5AD36 (hover: border-gold-soft)
- Black: #111827 (headings)
- Gradients:
  gradient-gold: linear-gradient(135deg, #D5AD36 0%, #E8C547 50%, #FAF0E0 100%)
  gradient-gold-soft: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(201,169,120,0.08) 0%, rgba(213,173,54,0.12) 100%)

## 🚀 ANIMATIONS (60FPS FRAMER MOTION ONLY)
EVERY interactive element MUST use Framer Motion:
- whileHover: { y: -6, scale: 1.05, boxShadow: '0 20px 40px rgba(24,31,101,0.15)' }
- whileTap: { scale: 0.98 }
- transition: { type: 'spring', stiffness: 400, damping: 20 }
- Page loads: initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 40 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
- NO CSS transitions—Framer Motion ONLY for pro effects

## 📱 RESPONSIVE (ZERO OVERFLOW)
- Container: max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8
- Typography: text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl
- Spacing: py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20
- Grids: grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4
- Mobile-first: sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl: breakpoints
- NO horizontal scroll: overflow-hidden where needed

## 🏗️ STRUCTURE (EXACT SECTIONS)
1. Hero: H1 "Find Your Perfect Course", tabs selector, CTA
2. Courses: Undergraduate/Postgrad/Professional tabs + cards
3. Universities: Plugin grid (4-col responsive)
4. Careers: Path cards with icons
5. About: Team avatars (navy-gold students)
6. Contact: Form + map

## 💎 STUDENT CONSULTANCY UX
- Trust: Navy authority + gold prestige
- Clarity: Large headings, bullet career paths
- Action: Gold CTAs "Know More →" with arrow slide
- Avatars: Diverse students (gold accents) from vecteezy/freepik
- Micro-interactions: Hover lifts, underline reveals

## ⚛️ CODE STANDARDS (ROBUST)
- React 18 + Tailwind + Framer Motion + React Router
- Components: PascalCase, props typed if TS
- Hooks: useState for tabs, useEffect for scroll
- Accessible: aria-label, focus-visible:ring-2 ring-gold-muted
- Performance: lazy load universities plugin
- NO complexity: Clean, standard patterns only

## 🎯 PROMPT FORMAT (ALWAYS FOLLOW)
When generating:
1. "Create [Hero/Courses/etc] component using EXACT rules above"
2. Output COMPLETE working code (imports + JSX + styles)
3. Test responsive: Mention breakpoints used
4. 60fps proof: Framer Motion on ALL hovers/CTAs

## ❌ NEVER DO
- Bright colors, gradients on backgrounds
- Complex nested components
- CSS animations (Framer ONLY)
- Fixed widths/heights
- Deviate from navy-gold-offwhite
- Mobile overflow

## ✅ ALWAYS IMPROVE
- Add subtle parallax scroll (Framer)
- Gold glow on focus/active
- Staggered card reveals (idx * 0.1 delay)
- Smooth tab underline slide
